{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>FinWall 是一款設計簡潔的個人財務追蹤應用程式，適合希望清晰掌握收支狀況、培養儲蓄習慣的用戶。這款原價 US $0.99 的 App 現正限時免費，提供一個直觀的儀表板，讓你一目瞭然所有財務動態。</p>\n\n<h2>清晰掌握財務全貌</h2>\n<p>FinWall 透過一個整合式儀表板，清晰呈現你的收入、固定支出、非必要開支、儲蓄及剩餘餘額。應用程式將支出劃分為負責任消費與非必要消費兩大類別，幫助你更理性地審視消費習慣。你亦可設定儲蓄目標，透過逐筆交易累積「磚塊」，直觀地觀察儲蓄進度。此外，它支援多幣種、多語言、iCloud 跨裝置同步，並提供 FaceID 或密碼鎖保護隱私，以及隨時匯出或匯入數據的功能。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1172-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1173-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1174-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1175-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1176-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1177-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：FinWall Budget &amp; Savings</li>\n<li>應用類別：Finance</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-27T01:14:02.951221+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":351,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}